  "sourceFinding": "The bound Blender fluid.cc applies volume_density only when is_gas_flow; liquid geometry uses the signed distance map. The bound RNA setter resets liquid surface_distance to 0.0 by default. This matrix therefore leaves volume_density observed at 0.0, restores zero source expansion and varies only the simulation particle-radius factor documented for leak/gain correction.",
